{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Dice Gameplay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Master the art of dice manipulation and wield powerful spells in <i>SpellRogue</i>, a turn-based deckbuilding roguelike where every roll shapes your fate. Control the fickle <strong>Mana Dice</strong> by rerolling, duplicating, splitting, flipping, and enchanting them with special effects. Bend luck to your will and unleash devastating magic! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1990110/extras/DiceManipulation_optimized.gif?t=1746087542\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Deep Tactical Combat</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Engage in battles with enemies directly <strong>disrupting your spells and dice</strong>:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udf44 <strong>Twisted mushrooms</strong> infect your spells with spreading debuffs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udd25 <strong>Fiery elementals</strong> ignite your spells, making them dangerous to cast.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udc80 <strong>Cursed Voidbringers </strong>doom your Dice to roll poorly and destabilizes spells.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Adapt, strategize, and turn the tide in your favor!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1990110/extras/combatGif.gif?t=1746087542\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>A World Consumed by the Void</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The <strong>Voidbringers </strong>have unleashed meteors of corruption, warping your once-peaceful world into a land of ravenous horrors. Journey through the <strong>Deadwoods, Scorched Desert, and beyond</strong>, track the source of this arcane blight, and purge the creeping darkness before it consumes everything.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1990110/extras/worldmapGif.gif?t=1746087542\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Dice Slingers &amp; Magic</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Meet the <strong>Dice Slingers</strong>, each wielding a unique elemental mastery and distinct ways to manipulate and control their Mana Dice. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1990110/extras/wizardsLineup.gif?t=1746087542\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><u><i>Azar the Cinder Conjurer</i></u>: Fueling the flames with his burning blood, he ignites small embers into raging infernos, unleashing devastating fire upon his foes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><u><i>Hazel the Earthen Mage</i></u>: Shaping the flow of life, she grows Mana Dice to incredible strength or withers foes to dust. The very earth bends to her will, rising to bolster her power.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><u><i>Lapis the Azure Seer</i></u>: A master of the tides, he commands the currents of Mana Dice, conjuring unyielding defenses, drowning foes in poison, and calling forth crashing waves of raw power.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i><u>Sefyra the Windcaller:</u></i> Wielding the wrath of a storm, she weaves the winds to align her spells in perfect harmony, and summons lightning to smite her enemies (Coming in 1.0). </p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>A Grand Adventure with Elegant Complexity</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1990110/extras/spellScrolling.gif?t=1746087542\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2728 <strong>350+ spells</strong>, each with <strong>two upgrades</strong> and unique animations and art.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2694\ufe0f <strong>75+ enemies</strong>, each with unique abilities to challenge your strategy.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\ud83d\udcb0145+ artifacts</strong> to shape and refine your build.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udfb2 <strong>Prove your mastery </strong>by boosting the difficulty with the Descent system.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udfc6 <strong>Take on Daily Challenges</strong> with ever-changing twists.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udff9 <strong>Battle through 3 acts</strong> to confront the <strong>Voidbringers</strong>, and uncover the truth!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Greed is Good","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1990110/50ae957803f6c05ad0839e0e466fb867c895a863.jpg"},{"name":"Mass Caster","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1990110/ef782fb536a995d035daf93b3734ed5d004c48b4.jpg"},{"name":"Devastator","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1990110/64523393f47952a137758191b1a8d25a756898e7.jpg"},{"name":"Alpha Strike","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1990110/a5510bea88274e28ec4cc0a16ef16f13c7ecc5b3.jpg"},{"name":"Spell Focus","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1990110/85ffed556bbaae20bbd8c51b2a7412b385483ee6.jpg"},{"name":"Archmage","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1990110/50e655660cf406cef72f3f345a03a06c7580cd89.jpg"},{"name":"Lucky Survivor","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1990110/7c017dac24f2ec1af5ddbbab0a786628705f9576.jpg"},{"name":"Countdown Supreme","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1990110/89626a145ba43a5ee9f21329f304165841947f50.jpg"},{"name":"Dice Hoarder","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1990110/b7f80a206fb512e8d91b70bfb80f94612f470284.jpg"},{"name":"Speed Slinger","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1990110/1c83541305095714038e44fa5aa65ef5d02c1c5d.jpg"}],"total":68},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1990110?t=1746087542","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1990110/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1746087542","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1990110/1b250aed0107d7769546a2943ce2899bd6fac59f/capsule_231x87_alt_assets_5.jpg?t=1746087542","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1990110/1b250aed0107d7769546a2943ce2899bd6fac59f/capsule_184x69_alt_assets_5.jpg?t=1746087542","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Dice Gameplay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Master the art of dice manipulation and wield powerful spells in <i>SpellRogue</i>, a turn-based deckbuilding roguelike where every roll shapes your fate. Control the fickle <strong>Mana Dice</strong> by rerolling, duplicating, splitting, flipping, and enchanting them with special effects. Bend luck to your will and unleash devastating magic! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1990110/extras/DiceManipulation_optimized.gif?t=1746087542\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Deep Tactical Combat</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Engage in battles with enemies directly <strong>disrupting your spells and dice</strong>:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udf44 <strong>Twisted mushrooms</strong> infect your spells with spreading debuffs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udd25 <strong>Fiery elementals</strong> ignite your spells, making them dangerous to cast.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udc80 <strong>Cursed Voidbringers </strong>doom your Dice to roll poorly and destabilizes spells.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Adapt, strategize, and turn the tide in your favor!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1990110/extras/combatGif.gif?t=1746087542\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>A World Consumed by the Void</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The <strong>Voidbringers </strong>have unleashed meteors of corruption, warping your once-peaceful world into a land of ravenous horrors. Journey through the <strong>Deadwoods, Scorched Desert, and beyond</strong>, track the source of this arcane blight, and purge the creeping darkness before it consumes everything.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1990110/extras/worldmapGif.gif?t=1746087542\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Dice Slingers &amp; Magic</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Meet the <strong>Dice Slingers</strong>, each wielding a unique elemental mastery and distinct ways to manipulate and control their Mana Dice. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1990110/extras/wizardsLineup.gif?t=1746087542\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><u><i>Azar the Cinder Conjurer</i></u>: Fueling the flames with his burning blood, he ignites small embers into raging infernos, unleashing devastating fire upon his foes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><u><i>Hazel the Earthen Mage</i></u>: Shaping the flow of life, she grows Mana Dice to incredible strength or withers foes to dust. The very earth bends to her will, rising to bolster her power.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><u><i>Lapis the Azure Seer</i></u>: A master of the tides, he commands the currents of Mana Dice, conjuring unyielding defenses, drowning foes in poison, and calling forth crashing waves of raw power.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i><u>Sefyra the Windcaller:</u></i> Wielding the wrath of a storm, she weaves the winds to align her spells in perfect harmony, and summons lightning to smite her enemies (Coming in 1.0). </p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>A Grand Adventure with Elegant Complexity</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1990110/extras/spellScrolling.gif?t=1746087542\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2728 <strong>350+ spells</strong>, each with <strong>two upgrades</strong> and unique animations and art.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2694\ufe0f <strong>75+ enemies</strong>, each with unique abilities to challenge your strategy.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\ud83d\udcb0145+ artifacts</strong> to shape and refine your build.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udfb2 <strong>Prove your mastery </strong>by boosting the difficulty with the Descent system.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udfc6 <strong>Take on Daily Challenges</strong> with ever-changing twists.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udff9 <strong>Battle through 3 acts</strong> to confront the <strong>Voidbringers</strong>, and uncover the truth!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","developers":["Guidelight Games"],"dlc":[2900220],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1990110/e9b7cca47303eb48b7493611815ba14f55a2d316/header_alt_assets_5.jpg?t=1746087542","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\">